#25500
"Animal Trail Through K'ssk Swamp"
"Little more than an animal path, a small trail winds itself through the swamps

here.  Much of the trail is a series of downtrodden vegetation and bog plants.

This small animal trail widens to the east, where it appears to merge with a

more even, well-traveled path through the swamps.  To the south, though, the

animal trail continues, snaking its way in and out of the swamps like a water

moccasin.

"
"||well-traveled path||animal trail||down-trodden vegetation|| bog plants||

