#25501
"Animal Trail Through K'ssk Swamp"
"A maze of plants, trees, and vines surrounds a path here, which curls its way

from north to west.  While the path to the north appears to narrow down and

become little more than a game trail, the western route widens.  To either

side of the western trail are thick, hanging vines.  Many of these same vines

and other swamp plants rise up to block progress to either the east or south.

