#25502
"Animal Trail Through K'ssk Swamp"
"The path here, which runs east to west, narrows considerably, as though most

animals fear to tred it.  Towards the west, the animal path manages a tight

squeeze between two old and sagging weeping willow trees.  The boughs of

taller trees loom overhead and merge together with one another, creating a

netting of canopy and trapping those below in a tunnel of plant life.  Thick

hanging vines droop down over the path in either direction.

