#25508
"Dry Clearing in K'ssk Swamp"
"This appears to be the southeastern part of a small clearing.  The clearing

itself rests atop a mound of earth that has become overgrown in a carpet of

short, green grass.  A dead cypress tree, rotten and broken, sticks up out of

the mound here.  Also, at one time, there seems to have been a path or trail

to the south, but masses of flowering vines have tangled themselves around it

and the nearby trees, blocking it.  Two small, narrow paths lead around the

mound to the north and west while a trail extends east, out of the clearing

and back into the swamp.

